#ROOM
Vnum     1
Name       System Nullspace~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors plr_home empty_home~
Desc       You are suspended in a sealed administrative nullspace used by the game
systems for temporary character storage and scripted operations.
~
#MUDPROG
Progtype  speech_prog~
Arglist   test2~
Comlist   say firstname of room:	 	$i
say short_desc/title of room: 	$I
say he/she/it of room:	 	$j
say him/her/it of room:	 	$k
say his/hers/its of room:	$l
say firstname of victim: 	$t
say short_desc/title of victim:	$T
say he/she/it of victim: 	$E
say him/her/it of victim: 	$M
say his/hers/its of victim:	$S
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  speech_prog~
Arglist   test~
Comlist   say triggered by (name):	$n
say triggered by (name&title): 	$N
say triggerer is (he,she,it):	$e
say triggerer is (him,her,it):	$m
say triggerer is (his,hers,its):$s
say random char (name):		$r
say random char (name&title or short): 	$R
say random char  (he,she,it):	$J
say random char (him,her,it):	$K
say random char (his,hers,its):	$L
~
#ENDPROG

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     2
Name       System Nexus~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors safe plr_home empty_home~
Desc       You stand in a quiet transfer chamber isolated from ordinary inhabited space.
Soft status lights mark the room as part of the system's recovery and routing
infrastructure rather than a normal destination.
~
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    32145
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 1 1 2
#ENDROOM

