#ROOM
Vnum     29
Name       Combat Arena - West Floor~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors norecall plr_home empty_home~
Desc       You stand on the western edge of a purpose-built combat arena. Tiered spectator
galleries rise beyond reinforced barriers while the arena floor opens toward
multiple attack routes.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    30
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    37
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    36
#ENDEXIT

#MUDPROG
Progtype  rand_prog~
Arglist   15~
Comlist   mpecho A measured chant rolls across the arena: "Enter prepared. Leave proven."
~
#ENDPROG

#MUDPROG
Progtype  death_prog~
Arglist   100~
Comlist   mpecho A deafening clamor of gleeful shouts rain down from above!
mpechoaround $n Trinkets, spittle and half-eaten food pelt down on your head.
mpechoaround $n Tokens of favor from an appreciative crowd.
~
#ENDPROG

#ENDROOM

